# Spectrum CSS Architecture Guidelines

## Overview
Follow these CSS patterns and conventions for all Spectrum components. Use `spectrum-button` as the exemplar for proper CSS architecture.

## 1. File Structure and Documentation

### File Header Documentation
```scss
// ==============================================
// Spectrum [Component] Component Styles
// ==============================================
// BEM naming convention: spectrum-[component] (block), __element (element), --modifier (modifier)
// Responsive design using CSS Grid and Flexbox
// CSS custom properties for theming integration
// ==============================================
```

