## 2. CSS Custom Properties Pattern

### :host Variable Declaration
Always declare component-level CSS custom properties in `:host` using Spectrum design tokens:

```scss
:host {
  display: block; // or inline-block for inline components
  
  // Core component properties
  --component-background: var(--spectrum-sys-color-surface, #ffffff);
  --component-color: var(--spectrum-sys-color-on-surface, #000000);
  --component-border-radius: var(--spectrum-sys-shape-corner-medium, 0.5rem);
  --component-padding: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing, 1rem);
  --component-font-family: var(--spectrum-sys-font-family, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif);
  --component-font-size: var(--spectrum-sys-font-size, 1rem);
  
  // Interactive states
  --component-hover-background: var(--spectrum-sys-color-surface-hover);
  --component-active-background: var(--spectrum-sys-color-surface-active);
  --component-focus-outline: var(--spectrum-sys-color-primary);
  --component-disabled-opacity: 0.5;
  
  // Animation and transitions
  --component-transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;
  --component-transition-duration: 0.2s;
  --component-transition-timing: ease-in-out;
  
  // Size variations
  --component-size-small: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing-large, 2rem);
  --component-size-medium: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing-x-large, 3rem);
  --component-size-large: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing-xx-large, 4rem);
  
  // Spacing variations
  --component-spacing-small: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing-small, 0.5rem);
  --component-spacing: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing, 1rem);
  --component-spacing-large: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing-large, 2rem);
}
```

### Variable Naming Convention
- Use `--component-property` format
- Group related properties together
- Always provide fallback values
- Reference Spectrum design tokens first

## 3. BEM Naming Convention

### Block-Element-Modifier Structure
```scss
// Block (component root)
.spectrum-component {
  // Base styles
}

// Elements (child components)
.spectrum-component__header {
  // Header styles
}

.spectrum-component__content {
  // Content styles
}

.spectrum-component__footer {
  // Footer styles
}

// Modifiers (variations)
.spectrum-component--primary {
  // Primary variant
}

.spectrum-component--large {
  // Large size variant
}

.spectrum-component--disabled {
  // Disabled state
}
```

### Nested BEM Structure
```scss
.spectrum-component {
  // Base component styles
  
  // Size modifiers
  &--small {
    --component-size: var(--component-size-small);
  }
  
  &--medium {
    --component-size: var(--component-size-medium);
  }
  
  &--large {
    --component-size: var(--component-size-large);
  }
  
  // Variant modifiers
  &--primary {
    --component-background: var(--spectrum-sys-color-primary);
    --component-color: var(--spectrum-sys-color-on-primary);
  }
  
  &--secondary {
    --component-background: var(--spectrum-sys-color-secondary);
    --component-color: var(--spectrum-sys-color-on-secondary);
  }
  
  // State modifiers
  &--disabled {
    opacity: var(--component-disabled-opacity);
    pointer-events: none;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  
  // Element styles
  &__icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: var(--component-icon-size);
  }
  
  &__text {
    font-family: var(--component-font-family);
    font-size: inherit;
    line-height: 1;
  }
}
```

## 4. Responsive Design Patterns

### Mobile-First Approach
```scss
// Base styles (mobile)
.spectrum-component {
  padding: var(--component-spacing-small);
  font-size: var(--spectrum-sys-typescale-body-small-size);
}

// Tablet and up
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .spectrum-component {
    padding: var(--component-spacing);
    font-size: var(--spectrum-sys-typescale-body-medium-size);
  }
}

// Desktop and up
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .spectrum-component {
    padding: var(--component-spacing-large);
    font-size: var(--spectrum-sys-typescale-body-large-size);
  }
}
```

### Responsive Variables
```scss
:host {
  // Responsive spacing
  --component-spacing-responsive: var(--component-spacing-small);
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    --component-spacing-responsive: var(--component-spacing);
  }
  
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    --component-spacing-responsive: var(--component-spacing-large);
  }
}
```

## 5. Layout Patterns

### Flexbox for Component Layout
```scss
.spectrum-component {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--component-spacing);
  
  // Responsive flex direction
  flex-direction: column;
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    flex-direction: row;
  }
}
```

### CSS Grid for Complex Layouts
```scss
.spectrum-component {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
  grid-template-areas: 
    "header"
    "content"
    "footer";
  gap: var(--component-spacing);
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    grid-template-areas: 
      "header header"
      "sidebar content"
      "footer footer";
  }
}

.spectrum-component__header {
  grid-area: header;
}

.spectrum-component__sidebar {
  grid-area: sidebar;
}

.spectrum-component__content {
  grid-area: content;
}

.spectrum-component__footer {
  grid-area: footer;
}
```

## 6. Animation and Transitions

### Standard Transitions
```scss
.spectrum-component {
  transition: var(--component-transition);
  
  // Hover states
  &:hover {
    background-color: var(--component-hover-background);
    transform: var(--component-hover-transform, translateY(-1px));
  }
  
  // Active states
  &:active {
    background-color: var(--component-active-background);
    transform: var(--component-active-transform, translateY(1px));
  }
  
  // Focus states
  &:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--component-focus-outline);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
}
```

### Reduced Motion Support
```scss
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .spectrum-component {
    --component-transition-duration: 0.01ms;
    --component-hover-transform: none;
    --component-active-transform: none;
  }
}
```

## 7. Accessibility Patterns

### Focus Management
```scss
.spectrum-component {
  // Remove default outline
  outline: none;
  
  // Custom focus styles
  &:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--spectrum-sys-color-primary);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  
  // High contrast mode support
  @media (prefers-contrast: high) {
    border: 1px solid;
  }
}
```

### Screen Reader Support
```scss
.spectrum-component {
  // Ensure proper text contrast
  color: var(--spectrum-sys-color-on-surface);
  background-color: var(--spectrum-sys-color-surface);
  
  // Hidden content for screen readers
  &__sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
}
```

## 8. Performance Optimization

### Efficient Selectors
```scss
// ✅ Good - specific and efficient
.spectrum-component__icon {
  display: flex;
}

// ❌ Avoid - overly nested
.spectrum-component .content .icon {
  display: flex;
}
```

### GPU Acceleration
```scss
.spectrum-component {
  // Use transform and opacity for animations
  transform: translateZ(0); // Force GPU layer
  will-change: transform; // Hint to browser
  
  &:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px) translateZ(0);
  }
}
```

## 9. Common Patterns

### Overlay Pattern
```scss
.spectrum-component {
  position: relative;
  
  &::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background-color: transparent;
    transition: background-color var(--component-transition-duration);
  }
  
  &:hover::before {
    background-color: var(--component-hover-overlay, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1));
  }
}
```

### Loading State Pattern
```scss
.spectrum-component {
  &--loading {
    position: relative;
    pointer-events: none;
    
    &::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      margin: -10px 0 0 -10px;
      border: 2px solid var(--spectrum-sys-color-primary);
      border-top-color: transparent;
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
    }
  }
}

@keyframes spin {
  to {
    transform: rotate(360deg);
  }
}
```

## 10. Best Practices

### Do's ✅
- Use Spectrum design tokens for all values
- Follow BEM naming convention consistently
- Document CSS sections with clear comments
- Use CSS custom properties for theming
- Implement responsive design mobile-first
- Support accessibility features
- Use efficient CSS selectors
- Group related properties together
- Provide fallback values for custom properties

### Don'ts ❌
- Don't use hardcoded values (use design tokens)
- Don't use `!important` unless explicitly agreed upon by the user
- Don't nest selectors more than 3 levels deep
- Don't use overly specific selectors
- Don't forget responsive design
- Don't ignore accessibility requirements
- Don't use deprecated CSS properties
- Don't mix different naming conventions

## 11. Example: Complete Component CSS

```scss
// ==============================================
// Spectrum Example Component Styles
// ==============================================
// BEM naming convention: spectrum-example (block), __element (element), --modifier (modifier)
// Responsive design using CSS Grid and Flexbox
// CSS custom properties for theming integration
// ==============================================

:host {
  display: block;
  
  // Core component properties
  --example-background: var(--spectrum-sys-color-surface, #ffffff);
  --example-color: var(--spectrum-sys-color-on-surface, #000000);
  --example-border-radius: var(--spectrum-sys-shape-corner-medium, 0.5rem);
  --example-padding: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing, 1rem);
  --example-font-family: var(--spectrum-sys-font-family, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif);
  
  // Spacing using proper Spectrum tokens
  --example-spacing-small: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing-small, 0.5rem);
  --example-spacing: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing, 1rem);
  --example-spacing-large: var(--spectrum-sys-spacing-large, 2rem);
}
// ==============================================
// Base Component Styles
// ==============================================
.spectrum-example {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background-color: var(--example-background);
  color: var(--example-color);
  border-radius: var(--example-border-radius);
  padding: var(--example-padding);
  font-family: var(--example-font-family);
  gap: var(--example-spacing);
  
  // ==============================================
  // Size Variations
  // ==============================================
  &--small {
    padding: var(--example-spacing-small);
    font-size: var(--spectrum-sys-typescale-body-small-size);
  }
  
  &--large {
    padding: var(--example-spacing-large);
    font-size: var(--spectrum-sys-typescale-body-large-size);
  }
  
  // ==============================================
  // Variant Styles
  // ==============================================
  &--primary {
    --example-background: var(--spectrum-sys-color-primary);
    --example-color: var(--spectrum-sys-color-on-primary);
  }
  
  // ==============================================
  // Element Styles
  // ==============================================
  &__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: var(--example-spacing-small);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--spectrum-sys-color-outline);
  }
  
  &__content {
    flex: 1;
    padding: var(--example-spacing-small) 0;
  }
  
  &__footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: var(--example-spacing-small);
    padding-top: var(--example-spacing-small);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--spectrum-sys-color-outline);
  }
}

// ==============================================
// Responsive Design
// ==============================================
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .spectrum-example {
    flex-direction: row;
    
    &__content {
      padding: 0 var(--example-spacing);
    }
  }
}
```

This comprehensive guide ensures consistent, maintainable, and accessible CSS across all Spectrum components.
